Språkidée
skapa egen parser

= funktionssyntax
```
fun foo(arg1 String): String {
    print('foo function')

    return 'foo'
}
```

= if syntax
```
if 1 == 2 {

} elif 1 == 3 {

} else {

}
```

= loop syntax
```
loop {
    puts('Hello, World')
}
```

```
while true {
    puts('Hello, World')
}
```

```
each i : [1, 2, 3, 4] {
    puts(i)
}
```

